00:57:33.250 --> 00:57:35.200
{kasoku shiteku}...faster and faster.

00:57:35.200 --> 00:57:41.000
{michibikidasu seikai, kotae nante nai}Try to find the right answer, but there's no such thing.

00:57:52.600 --> 00:57:55.300
Hey daddy, tell me... I wonder why those people fight.

00:57:55.300 --> 00:57:57.850
For their name ? For their cash, or for their pride ?

00:57:57.850 --> 00:58:00.400
{kazaranai massugu tukisasu your eyes}Those piercingly honest eyes of yours.

00:58:00.400 --> 00:58:03.200
I'm going down. (I'm going down.)

00:58:03.200 --> 00:58:05.500
But everybody's saying, "We're right all the time."

00:58:05.500 --> 00:58:08.300
{ecuz zettai teki seigi wo kakagetai}`cuz they want to stick to absolute justice.

00:58:08.300 --> 00:58:10.800
{Theyfre never turning back. Hitei saretakunai}They're never turning back. Never want to be denied.

00:58:10.800 --> 00:58:14.200
But it's falling down. (It's falling down)

00:58:14.200 --> 00:58:19.400
{hiraita kizu ni kako wo surikonde}Patching up the open wounds with the past.

00:58:19.400 --> 00:58:24.650
{wasure rarenai itami omoidashite}Remembering the pain that never fades away.

00:58:24.650 --> 00:58:28.650
{nukihanatsu my blade}I draw my blade.

00:58:28.650 --> 00:58:34.650
{ima hero ni natte gkono sekai wo sukuuh toka}It's not about becoming a hero to save the world.

00:58:34.650 --> 00:58:39.200
{sonnanja nakute koe kareru made}Instead, until my voice wears thin...

00:58:39.200 --> 00:58:49.000
{tonari de nakimushi na kimi ga warau mirai wo utaitai kara}...I want to sing of the future when the crybaby next to me only smiles.

00:58:49.000 --> 00:58:50.650
{tatakai tsuzukeru} I continue to fight.

00:58:50.650 --> 00:58:53.250
Who the fuck do you think you're talking to ? Dumb ass !

00:58:53.250 --> 00:58:55.900
{Donft get carried away, hanatare ga kojirasu}"Don't get carried away," says a snot-nose brat.

00:58:55.900 --> 00:58:58.500
{iki wa iiga torima Should I kick eem asses?}Gutsy, for now, and goes "Should I kick `eem asses?"

00:58:58.500 --> 00:59:01.200
{koe ga chiiseena Whacha say, huh ?}With a faint voice. "Whacha say, huh ?"

00:59:12.650 --> 00:59:20.650
{When I close my eyes, kimi no namida ga yakitsuite}When I close my eyes, I see your tears burnt into mine.

00:59:20.650 --> 00:59:26.050
{mune ni tsuyoku chikai, mou mayoi wa nai}I swear to myself. I'll never back down.

